{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>iCPainter 可把相片轉化為一幅逐筆繪製的畫作，並在螢幕上呈現上色過程；適合喜歡油畫效果、製作縮時影片或重繪作品的用家。原價 US $0.99，現時<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-206.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>多種畫風與手繪工具</h2>\n<p>程式提供濕油畫、油畫、厚塗與水彩四種畫風，筆觸會依相片輪廓與細節變化，並可一鍵重繪新版本。用家能調整紙張紋理、浮雕感、對比度、鮮豔度與筆刷細節，亦可加入鉛筆、墨水或素描線條；以手指或 Apple Pencil 手繪時，力度可控制筆刷大小，完成後輸出高解像度圖像或繪畫縮時影片。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-235-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-236-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-237-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-238-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-239-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-240-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：iCPainter: Photo to Painting</li><li>應用類別：Photo &amp; Video</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/icpainter-photo-to-painting/id1216949590?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T21:43:45.513254+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T21:19:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T21:14:39.603257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T21:37:15.022035+00:00","content_hash":"9f02689c394a918cc9873ff3679e05a8673823898c81609fdeee10c5fa9e6b24","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}